---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import {directions} from '../data/academy';
---
<Layout title="About the academy" description="Discover SamkhyaAcademy’s approach to software, machine learning, AI delivery, space systems, leadership learning and startup advisory."><PageHero image="knowledge-bridge" imageAlt="Conceptual bridge between knowledge and practical building" caption="Different starting points. A shared habit of making." eyebrow="About the academy" title="Build skills. Find your direction." description="SamkhyaAcademy brings structured learning and practical projects together for students, engineers and leaders. Through Venture Launchpad, founders can also explore startup advisory from idea to execution."/>
<section class="container section two-grid about-story"><div class="about-poster"><span class="eyebrow light">THE IDEA BEHIND THE ACADEMY</span><p>Curiosity.<br/>Practice.<br/><span>Possibility.</span></p><span>Learn enough to build. Build enough to learn.</span></div><div class="prose"><h2>Different starting points. Purposeful learning.</h2><p>A student learning Python, an engineer integrating AI into an enterprise workflow, a college team exploring satellite systems, a leader assessing an AI pilot and a founder testing a problem all need different starting points. They also share a need for practical work and useful feedback.</p><p>Our program directions reflect those differences. The AI Engineering Training Internship builds foundations. Dedicated Machine Learning and Full-Stack Development programs offer focused learning paths. Forward Deployment Engineering develops a delivery perspective. FDE for Leaders connects AI opportunities to funding, governance and adoption decisions. Space Technology connects engineering disciplines. Venture Launchpad offers a startup advisory path from ideation to execution, with engagement scope agreed for each venture.</p><h2>Learn it. Build it. Explain it.</h2><p>A useful project gives you more than a finished screen. It helps you explain the problem, choose an approach, test your assumptions and respond to feedback. Our curriculum and project guides show the work you can practise and the evidence you can develop along the way.</p></div></section>
<section class="tinted section"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">DIFFERENT STARTING POINTS</p><h2>Choose the work that fits your next step.</h2><div class="about-directions">{directions.map(d=><article class="feature"><span class="feature-icon"><Icon name={d.icon}/></span><h3>{d.title}</h3><p class="eyebrow">{d.audience}</p><p>{d.copy}</p><a class="text-link" href={d.href}>Explore the direction <Icon name="arrowRight"/></a></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="container section"><p class="eyebrow">OUR APPROACH</p><h2>Three habits behind the work.</h2><div class="three-grid">{[['Begin with context','Understand the learner, the user or the mission before choosing tools. Readiness and objectives shape the appropriate starting point.'],['Learn through evidence','Connect concepts to a test, an experiment or an observable result. Keep the evidence clear enough for another person to review.'],['Build with others','Explain decisions, share interfaces and credit contributions. Practical work becomes stronger when different perspectives can meet.']].map(([title,copy],i)=><article class="feature approach-feature"><span class="feature-icon"><Icon name={["compass","flask","users"][i]}/></span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{copy}</p></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="container section"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR LEARNING EXPERIENCE</p><h2>Know what you’re working towards.</h2><div class="three-grid">{[['book','A clear learning path','Explore prerequisites, modules and tools before choosing a program. Discuss readiness and learning arrangements with the academy.'],['layers','Projects with a purpose','Build in stages, review what works and document your decisions. Each track connects practical exercises to a demonstration or case study.'],['check','Completion you can recognise','Receive an academy completion certificate after meeting your learning program’s requirements. Pair it with the work and explanations you develop during learning.']].map(([icon,title,copy])=><article class="feature approach-feature"><span class="feature-icon"><Icon name={icon}/></span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{copy}</p></article>)}</div><p class="caption">Explore the <a href="/#completion-recognition">illustrative completion certificate</a>. Venture Launchpad follows a separately agreed advisory engagement.</p></section>
<section class="container section section-tight two-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">INDIVIDUALS & INSTITUTIONS</p><h2>A conversation before a commitment.</h2><p>Individuals can explore a technical track, develop AI leadership judgment or share a venture brief. Faculty coordinators can enquire about group learning objectives, student backgrounds and available facilities. Scope, teaching arrangements and support are discussed before commitments are made.</p></div><article class="readiness-card"><h3>Clear expectations</h3><p>Published projects describe planned learning opportunities. They do not promise employment, funding, a satellite launch or an institutional affiliation.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Contact the academy <Icon name="arrowRight"/></a></article></section><CTA/></Layout>
<style>.approach-feature{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff,#f3f7fc)}.approach-feature h3{margin-top:18px}.approach-feature .feature-icon{color:#285587;background:#e5eef9}.about-directions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:22px;margin-top:28px}.about-directions h3{margin:18px 0}.about-directions .eyebrow{font-size:.65rem;margin-bottom:14px}.about-directions .text-link{margin-top:20px}@media(max-width:600px){.about-directions{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>